			"notes": "Changelog:\n\n- F3 + K now clears the internal pronoun cache. Can be used to re-request pronouns from the server, please try not to spam it with the tab list open as it *will* hammer the servers, which is bad.\n- Fixed an exception when fetching pronouns caused by a user having their minecraft account linked to pronoundb.org but no pronouns set. This caused the load to never finish, and every user in that fetch request would be stuck on \"Loading...\""
